system_prompt:
You label short commands given to a voice assistant.
Reply with exactly one line of JSON and nothing else. The JSON has three keys, scenario, intent and slots.
scenario must be one of: alarm, audio, calendar, cooking, datetime, email, general, iot, lists, music, news, play, qa, recommendation, social, takeaway, transport, weather.
intent must be one of: alarm_query, alarm_remove, alarm_set, audio_volume_down, audio_volume_mute, audio_volume_other, audio_volume_up, calendar_query, calendar_remove, calendar_set, cooking_query, cooking_recipe, datetime_convert, datetime_query, email_addcontact, email_query, email_querycontact, email_sendemail, general_greet, general_joke, general_quirky, iot_cleaning, iot_coffee, iot_hue_lightchange, iot_hue_lightdim, iot_hue_lightoff, iot_hue_lighton, iot_hue_lightup, iot_wemo_off, iot_wemo_on, lists_createoradd, lists_query, lists_remove, music_dislikeness, music_likeness, music_query, music_settings, news_query, play_audiobook, play_game, play_music, play_podcasts, play_radio, qa_currency, qa_definition, qa_factoid, qa_maths, qa_stock, recommendation_events, recommendation_locations, recommendation_movies, social_post, social_query, takeaway_order, takeaway_query, transport_query, transport_taxi, transport_ticket, transport_traffic, weather_query.
slots is a list of [slot_type, value] pairs in the order the values appear in the text.
Each value must be copied word for word from the text. Use [] when the text has no slots.
slot_type must be one of: alarm_type, app_name, artist_name, audiobook_author, audiobook_name, business_name, business_type, change_amount, coffee_type, color_type, cooking_type, currency_name, date, definition_word, device_type, drink_type, email_address, email_folder, event_name, food_type, game_name, game_type, general_frequency, house_place, ingredient, joke_type, list_name, meal_type, media_type, movie_name, movie_type, music_album, music_descriptor, music_genre, news_topic, order_type, person, personal_info, place_name, player_setting, playlist_name, podcast_descriptor, podcast_name, radio_name, relation, song_name, sport_type, time, time_zone, timeofday, transport_agency, transport_descriptor, transport_name, transport_type, weather_descriptor.
Examples.
Text: wake me up at nine am on friday
JSON: {"scenario":"alarm","intent":"alarm_set","slots":[["time","nine am"],["date","friday"]]}
Text: olly quiet
JSON: {"scenario":"audio","intent":"audio_volume_mute","slots":[]}
Text: check when the show starts
JSON: {"scenario":"calendar","intent":"calendar_query","slots":[]}
Text: what to cook for lunch
JSON: {"scenario":"cooking","intent":"cooking_query","slots":[["meal_type","lunch"]]}
Text: tell me the time in moscow
JSON: {"scenario":"datetime","intent":"datetime_query","slots":[["place_name","moscow"]]}
Text: i did not want you to send that text yet wait until i say send
JSON: {"scenario":"email","intent":"email_sendemail","slots":[]}
Text: check my car is ready
JSON: {"scenario":"general","intent":"general_quirky","slots":[]}
Text: make the lighting bit more warm here
JSON: {"scenario":"iot","intent":"iot_hue_lightchange","slots":[["color_type","warm"]]}
Text: i finished my to do list
JSON: {"scenario":"lists","intent":"lists_query","slots":[]}
Text: i like rock music
JSON: {"scenario":"music","intent":"music_likeness","slots":[["music_genre","rock"]]}
Text: what's happening in football today
JSON: {"scenario":"news","intent":"news_query","slots":[["news_topic","football"],["date","today"]]}
Text: i want to listen arijit singh song once again
JSON: {"scenario":"play","intent":"play_music","slots":[["artist_name","arijit singh"]]}
Text: keep me updated on stock market prices
JSON: {"scenario":"qa","intent":"qa_stock","slots":[["news_topic","stock market prices"]]}
Text: find me a nice restaurant for dinner
JSON: {"scenario":"recommendation","intent":"recommendation_locations","slots":[["business_type","restaurant"],["meal_type","dinner"]]}
Text: what is going on right now on twitter
JSON: {"scenario":"social","intent":"social_query","slots":[["media_type","twitter"]]}
Text: olly list most rated delivery options for chinese food
JSON: {"scenario":"takeaway","intent":"takeaway_query","slots":[["order_type","delivery"],["food_type","chinese"]]}
Text: you need to give me different directions
JSON: {"scenario":"transport","intent":"transport_query","slots":[]}
Text: is it raining
JSON: {"scenario":"weather","intent":"weather_query","slots":[["weather_descriptor","raining"]]}
